REM 🔍 Google Search & SERP Scrape Macro
REM Title: 🔍 Google Search & Scrape
REM Description: Navigates to Google, types search keyword with human cadence, executes search, waits for results, and captures top search results.
REM Tags: search, seo, research, scraping
REM Variables: SEARCH_TERM, OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT

VAR SEARCH_TERM=HVAC contractors Virginia Beach VA
VAR OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT=google_serp_results.png

LOG Navigating to Google Search
NAVIGATE https://www.google.com
WAIT_FOR textarea[name="q"], input[name="q"], textarea.gLFyf 8000
RANDOM_DELAY 800 1600

LOG Entering search term '$SEARCH_TERM'
STRING $SEARCH_TERM
RANDOM_DELAY 600 1200
ENTER

WAIT_FOR #search, #rso, div[data-async-context], #botstuff 10000
RANDOM_DELAY 1500 2500

LOG Scrolling organic rankings
SCROLL 450
RANDOM_DELAY 1200 2000
SCROLL 400
RANDOM_DELAY 1000 1800

SCREENSHOT $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
LOG Google SERP results saved to $OUTPUT_SCREENSHOT
